quiz.prompt:
The relay module is energised by LOW and starts released. analogRead returns 650, 550 and 480 in turn. What is the relay's state after each reading?

```
if (!acik && deger > 600) {
  acik = true;
  digitalWrite(7, LOW);
} else if (acik && deger < 500) {
  acik = false;
  digitalWrite(7, HIGH);
}
```

When the threshold is passed, the relay pulls in, but it releases straight away, pulls in again and clicks all the time. Which line is wrong?

```
if (!acik && deger > ACMA) {
  acik = true;
  digitalWrite(ROLE, LOW);
} else if (acik && deger > KAPAMA) {
  acik = false;
  digitalWrite(ROLE, HIGH);
}
```
(ACMA = 600, KAPAMA = 500)
